WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.949
Mr. Smith: Danny, don’t bother the other students.

2
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.945
Tina: You’re going to get into trouble.

3
00:00:10.946 --> 00:00:14.306
Danny: I need to look at you more closely.

4
00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:16.662
Tina: What are you talking about?

5
00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:22.305
Danny: Come here and look! See?

6
00:00:22.306 --> 00:00:24.680
Tina: That’s pretty good, Danny.

7
00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:27.835
Danny: Yeah, but I’m missing something.

8
00:00:27.836 --> 00:00:33.307
Brad: She’s right. That looks good, Danny.

9
00:00:33.308 --> 00:00:36.115
Dave: Hey! Look at this!

10
00:00:36.116 --> 00:00:41.628
Chuck: Well, well, well. Isn’t this cute!

11
00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:45.520
Danny: Just leave me alone.

12
00:00:45.521 --> 00:00:49.256
Chuck: Aww. He likes the girl!

13
00:00:49.258 --> 00:00:51.812
Dave: He’s in love with her.

14
00:00:51.813 --> 00:00:56.693
Chuck: Are you guys going to get married?

15
00:00:56.694 --> 00:01:00.232
Danny: Give me that!

16
00:01:00.233 --> 00:01:03.399
Dave: He wants his girlfriend back.

17
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.485
Danny: She’s not my girlfriend!

18
00:01:06.486 --> 00:01:10.586
Stop! You’re squishing my model!

19
00:01:10.587 --> 00:01:13.840
Tina: Why don’t you leave him alone?

20
00:01:13.841 --> 00:01:16.202
Chuck: Isn’t that sweet?

21
00:01:16.203 --> 00:01:19.197
She's standing up for her boyfriend.

22
00:01:19.198 --> 00:01:22.373
Tina: You don’t want to make me angry.

23
00:01:22.374 --> 00:01:26.053
Dave: Why? What’s going to happen?

24
00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:32.055
Tina: Have you forgotten what happened last week?

25
00:01:32.056 --> 00:01:35.101
Chuck: Here’s your little doll back!

26
00:01:35.102 --> 00:01:38.854
Dave: You’re lucky that your girlfriend is strong.

27
00:01:38.855 --> 00:01:42.801
Danny: SHE’S NOT MY GIRLFRIEND!

28
00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:46.124
Tina: Danny, quiet.

29
00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:48.082
Mr. Smith: What’s going on here?

30
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.192
Why are you yelling, Danny?

31
00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:53.447
Danny: These guys are driving me crazy!

32
00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:56.504
Mr. Smith: Danny, I think you’re driving me crazy.

33
00:01:56.505 --> 00:01:58.444
Tina: No, really, Mr. Smith.

34
00:01:58.445 --> 00:02:02.647
These boys were picking on Danny.

35
00:02:02.648 --> 00:02:04.689
Mr. Smith: Is that true, boys?

36
00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.768
Dave: No, Mr. Smith.

37
00:02:06.769 --> 00:02:09.847
Chuck: We just like his clay models.

38
00:02:09.848 --> 00:02:13.956
Dave: Yeah. We think they’re really good.

39
00:02:13.957 --> 00:02:16.919
Mr. Smith: Danny? What do you have to say?

40
00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:24.385
Danny: They . . . are . . . big . . . stinking . . . LIARS!

41
00:02:24.386 --> 00:02:26.967
Mr. Smith: Danny, that’s enough!

42
00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:31.537
Tina: Danny, calm down.

43
00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:33.357
Brad: Mr. Smith?

44
00:02:33.359 --> 00:02:34.883
Mr. Smith: Yes, Brad.

45
00:02:34.884 --> 00:02:37.919
Brad: I can prove that Danny is innocent.

46
00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:44.575
Mr. Smith: Brad, please return to your desk.

47
00:02:44.576 --> 00:02:46.933
Everybody, back to your desks.

48
00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:49.266
Danny: But Mr. Smith. . .

49
00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:50.570
Mr. Smith: That’s enough, Danny.

50
00:02:50.571 --> 00:02:55.114
We will not be using clay anymore today!

